[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 119 A true",
    "start": 0.75,
    "end": 4.612,
    "zh": "第119课 一个真实的故事",
    "zh_hant": "第119課 一個真實的故事"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "story",
    "start": 4.352,
    "end": 5.272,
    "zh": "故事",
    "zh_hant": "故事"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.393,
    "end": 9.274,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 9.095,
    "end": 11.015,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Who called out to the thieves in the dark?",
    "start": 11.976,
    "end": 16.198,
    "zh": "谁在黑暗中向小偷喊话？",
    "zh_hant": "誰在黑暗中向小偷喊話？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Do you like stories?",
    "start": 18.339,
    "end": 20.66,
    "zh": "你喜欢故事吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你喜歡故事嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I want to tell you a true story.",
    "start": 21.741,
    "end": 24.802,
    "zh": "我想给你讲一个真实的故事。",
    "zh_hant": "我想給你講一個真實的故事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It happened to a friend of mine a year ago.",
    "start": 25.463,
    "end": 29.404,
    "zh": "这发生在我一个朋友身上，是在一年前。",
    "zh_hant": "這發生在我一個朋友身上，是在一年前。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "While my friend, George,",
    "start": 30.665,
    "end": 33.667,
    "zh": "当我的朋友乔治",
    "zh_hant": "當我的朋友喬治"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "was reading in bed,",
    "start": 33.787,
    "end": 35.928,
    "zh": "正在床上看书时，",
    "zh_hant": "正在床上看書時，"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "two thieves climbed into his kitchen.",
    "start": 36.188,
    "end": 40.11,
    "zh": "两个小偷爬进了他的厨房。",
    "zh_hant": "兩個小偷爬進了他的廚房。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "After they had entered the house,",
    "start": 41.051,
    "end": 43.892,
    "zh": "他们进入房子后，",
    "zh_hant": "他們進入房子後，"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "they went into the dining room.",
    "start": 44.192,
    "end": 47.134,
    "zh": "走进了餐厅。",
    "zh_hant": "走進了餐廳。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "It was very dark,",
    "start": 47.634,
    "end": 50.095,
    "zh": "那里很黑，",
    "zh_hant": "那裡很黑，"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "so they turned on a torch.",
    "start": 50.576,
    "end": 53.777,
    "zh": "所以他们打开了手电筒。",
    "zh_hant": "所以他們開啟了手電筒。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Suddenly, they heard a voice behind them.",
    "start": 54.658,
    "end": 59.1,
    "zh": "突然，他们听到身后有个声音。",
    "zh_hant": "突然，他們聽到身後有個聲音。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "'What's up?",
    "start": 59.34,
    "end": 61.381,
    "zh": "“怎么了？",
    "zh_hant": "“怎麼了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "What's up?'",
    "start": 61.541,
    "end": 62.842,
    "zh": "怎么了？”",
    "zh_hant": "怎麼了？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "someone called.",
    "start": 63.422,
    "end": 64.863,
    "zh": "有人喊道。",
    "zh_hant": "有人喊道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "The thieves dropped the torch and ran away",
    "start": 65.743,
    "end": 70.165,
    "zh": "小偷丢下手电筒，",
    "zh_hant": "小偷丟下手電筒，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "as quickly as they could.",
    "start": 70.005,
    "end": 73.087,
    "zh": "尽可能快地逃跑了。",
    "zh_hant": "儘可能快地逃跑了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "George heard the noise",
    "start": 74.208,
    "end": 76.548,
    "zh": "乔治听到了响声，",
    "zh_hant": "喬治聽到了響聲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "and came downstairs quickly.",
    "start": 76.389,
    "end": 79.37,
    "zh": "迅速下了楼。",
    "zh_hant": "迅速下了樓。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "He turned on the light,",
    "start": 80.191,
    "end": 82.392,
    "zh": "他打开灯，",
    "zh_hant": "他開啟燈，"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "but he couldn't see anyone.",
    "start": 82.913,
    "end": 85.595,
    "zh": "但什么人也看不见。",
    "zh_hant": "但什麼人也看不見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "The thieves had already gone.",
    "start": 86.276,
    "end": 89.177,
    "zh": "小偷已经走了。",
    "zh_hant": "小偷已經走了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "But George's parrot, Henry,",
    "start": 89.938,
    "end": 93.16,
    "zh": "但乔治的鹦鹉亨利",
    "zh_hant": "但喬治的鸚鵡亨利"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "was still there.",
    "start": 93.221,
    "end": 94.921,
    "zh": "还在那里。",
    "zh_hant": "還在那裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "What's up, George?",
    "start": 95.702,
    "end": 97.343,
    "zh": "“怎么了，乔治？”",
    "zh_hant": "“怎麼了，喬治？”"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "he called.",
    "start": 97.684,
    "end": 98.904,
    "zh": "它喊道。",
    "zh_hant": "它喊道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "'Nothing, Henry,'",
    "start": 98.865,
    "end": 101.907,
    "zh": "“没什么，亨利，”",
    "zh_hant": "“沒什麼，亨利，”"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "George said and smiled.",
    "start": 101.557,
    "end": 103.848,
    "zh": "乔治说着，笑了。",
    "zh_hant": "喬治說著，笑了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "'Go back to sleep.'",
    "start": 104.089,
    "end": 106.59,
    "zh": "“回去睡觉吧。”",
    "zh_hant": "“回去睡覺吧。”"
  }
]
